Adds `[auth.providers.<id>]` to leptoskit.toml, naming the environment variables its secrets go in, and prints how to set the provider up

Usage: leptoskit auth provider add [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  `google`, `apple`, `microsoft`, `github`, or your own ID for an OpenID Connect issuer, such as `company`

Options:
      --issuer <ISSUER>  For an OpenID Connect provider: its issuer, such as `https://sso.example.com`
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
